{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-02/1062818/block/singleImage/3262155/df/%E9%87%8D%E6%85%B6.jpg?updatedAt=1794214861\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀重慶大廈。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>尖沙咀重慶大廈揭發虐畜案。 今日（9日）中午約12時46分，尖沙咀彌敦道40號重慶大廈職員，發現有一男一女租客已有約20日未現身，單位內卻一直傳出狗吠聲，於是報警。警方和救援人員趕至破門，發現一隻長約1米的啡色狗被獨留單位，缺乏食水及糧食，遂召愛護動物協會人員到場協助、並帶走該隻狗檢查。警方將案件暫列「殘酷對待動物」，交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第七隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.780158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:20.069734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.762173+00:00","content_hash":"a88f55d7d88d019c66d6bd620443870d4347c8a6359746f03e06b61c6ba47fc9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.780158+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}